Scope
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

This license covers the visual identity assets in this repository — the
AstroGeo logo and its variants, lockups, icons and preview images, i.e.
everything under:

    01-mark/   02-mono/   03-favicon/
    04-lockup/ 05-social-preview/ 06-alternates/

The build scripts under tools/ exist for convenience only and are not
part of the licensed visual identity. You may use and adapt them freely
within this repository.

